OL,3,GNEWSA'I would be dead if I had not
OL,4,Alearnt about little-known law'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details.
OL,9,FAfter being beaten and abused by her
OL,10,Fpartner for 10 years, Eleanor had no
OL,11,Fself-esteem or strength left.
OL,13,FDuring this time, she experienced years
OL,14,Fof abuse, including a fractured jaw six
OL,15,Fweeks into the relationship.
OL,17,FBut she said one thing helped her break
OL,18,Fthe painful cycle, and that was when
OL,19,Fcharity workers told her about a law
OL,20,Fwhich allows people to request
OL,21,Finformation about their partner's
OL,22,Fviolent offending history.
